00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.510
(soft music)

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:11.510
Letting somebody else dictate your life

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:13.520
is immediate unhappiness.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:14.620
You're not in control.

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.060
There is nothing, nothing, more difficult

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:23.663
than navigating your life based
on somebody else's opinion.

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:27.960
You actually care about
what your dad or mom

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:31.050
or grandma or husband or wife or daughter

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:33.910
or son is gonna say about
you if you do this thing.

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:35.650
It doesn't matter what they think.

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:37.459
When you're fuckin' 92
and you're sitting there

00:00:37.459 --> 00:00:39.970
you're not gonna give a shit about what

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:42.600
punkman96 had to say.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.730
