00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:55.350
because that's their energy.

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:56.700
In work I see it everyday.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:58.180
In life I see it everyday.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:00:59.673
It's just what it is.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:03.230
I hate how many people judge other people

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:04.920
