00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:07.430
Every time you fuckin' judge
you make yourself vulnerable.

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:10.370
99.9% of the people that you
judge or have opinions on

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:12.030
