00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:19.340
Everybody sucks at something, right?

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:21.090
We all have shortcomings.

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.120
And for me it's like why
don't we just audit that?

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:25.580
Why don't we just look at it that way?

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:28.132
And be like, I'm good at this,
but I'm not good at that.

00:01:28.132 --> 00:01:29.703
Everybody's so absolute.

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:34.561
Are you really really really
not gonna live your life

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:38.670
based on somebody's anonymous
fuckin' icon feedback

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:40.930
that you suck, they fuckin' suck.

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:43.320
Go do your thing, don't listen to anybody

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:45.670
but what's in your fuckin'
mind and the fuckin' heart.

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:47.130
And not living a life where you allow

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:49.650
other people's judgment
to dictate your behavior.

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:51.217
You're letting your homie or your aunt

00:01:51.217 --> 00:01:53.290
