00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:56.070
When you can get to that
place, amazing shit happens.

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:57.460
You know why?

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:59.260
'Cause you stop being scared.

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:01.280
And I want that for every fuckin' person

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:05.150
